<title>USA: CalEnergy Co names Hammett CFO.</title>
<headline>CalEnergy Co names Hammett CFO.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>CalEnergy Co said Friday it named Craig Hammett vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that its previous chief financial officer John Sylvia was leaving to become a principal in a private investment company on the West Coast.</p>
<p>Hammett was previously manager of project finance for the power company.</p>
